The '''Potato War Silver Medal''' is an {{Epic}} item awarded to {{RN|yt|im_a_squid_kid}} for the second place on Great Potato War. It was awarded to him by the [[Potato King]]. There is only one in existence in SkyBlock.

== Trivia ==
*Unlike the {{Item|Basket of Hope from the Great Potato War}}, this item didn't become a [[Memento]].
